case 'finance.post':province601_(u);return lock601_(()=>{let {r,d}=rec601_(u,q,true);if(d.approval!=='APPROVED'||!['cap','paid'].includes(q.kind))throw Error('INVALID_STATE');let amount=amount601_(q.amount),date=date601_(q.date),ref=text601_(q.ref,100);if(!amount||!ref||date>today601_())throw Error('INVALID_REQUEST');let tx=readV60_('Transactions').filter(x=>String(x.recordId)===String(r.id));if(tx.some(x=>norm603_(x.ref).trim()===norm603_(ref).trim()))throw Error('DUPLICATE_REF');let cap=tx.filter(x=>x.kind==='cap').reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.amount),0),paid=tx.filter(x=>x.kind==='paid').reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.amount),0);if(cap!==Number(d.kinhPhiDaCap||0)||paid!==Number(d.kinhPhiGiaiNgan||0))throw Error('LEDGER_MISMATCH');if(d.ngayDuyet&&date<d.ngayDuyet)throw Error('INVALID_DATE');if(q.kind==='cap')cap+=amount;else paid+=amount;if(cap>Number(d.kinhPhiTinh||0)+Number(d.kinhPhiCoSo||0)||paid>cap)throw Error('EXCEEDS_BUDGET');sheetV60_('Transactions').appendRow([next603_(q.kind==='cap'?'CP':'GN',date.slice(0,4)),r.id,r.unitId,q.kind,amount,date,ref,u.email]);d.kinhPhiDaCap=cap;d.kinhPhiGiaiNgan=paid;return save601_(u,r,d,q.action)});
case 'evidence.list':{let {r}=rec601_(u,q,false);return list601_(u,'Evidence').filter(x=>String(x.recordId)===String(r.id)).map(({fileId,...x})=>x)}
case 'evidence.upload':return lock601_(()=>{let {r}=rec601_(u,q,true);let mime=q.mime,name=text601_(q.name,150);if(!['image/png','image/jpeg','application/pdf'].includes(mime)||typeof q.base64!=='string'||q.base64.length>7000000)throw Error('INVALID_FILE');let bytes=Utilities.base64Decode(q.base64);if(!bytes.length||bytes.length>5*1024*1024||!signature601_(bytes,mime))throw Error('INVALID_FILE');let file=folder601_().createFile(Utilities.newBlob(bytes,mime,name)),id=Utilities.getUuid();try{sheetV60_('Evidence').appendRow([id,r.id,r.unitId,file.getId(),name,mime,bytes.length])}catch(e){file.setTrashed(true);throw e}auditV60_(u,q.action,r.id,r.unitId);return {id}});
